  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive and sustainable value chains and food fortification</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme has two main goals: poverty reduction and improvement of nutritional status. It aims at developing: a) inclusive and sustainable agriculture based value chains one side and b) food fortification on the other.</narrative>
